id: TEST-014
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Test uses sleep instead of proper waiting
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .test.ts .test.js .spec.ts .spec.js _test.go _test.py
  exclude_paths: test/fixtures/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: toBe
patterns:
  - regex: \b(sleep|setTimeout|time\.sleep|Thread\.sleep)\(
    message: "sleep in test — use fake timers, polling, or waitFor instead"
fix: Use jest.useFakeTimers(), testing-library waitFor(), or polling assertions. Sleep makes tests slow and flaky.
